  "question": {
    "text": "Addition of sodium thiosulphate solution to a solution of silver nitrate gives $X$ as white precipitate, insoluble in water but soluble in excess thiosulphate solution to give $Y$. On boiling in water, $Y$ gives $Z . X, Y$ and $Z$ respectively are",
